<title>HUNGARY: IBUSZ H1 PRE-TAX LOSS RISES TO HUF76.9MLN.</title>
<headline>IBUSZ H1 PRE-TAX LOSS RISES TO HUF76.9MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997	Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating result	    89.1 loss   vs     35.5 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		76.9 loss   vs     11.7 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales		  1,145.4	  vs  1,932.6</p>
<p>    Material expenditures    573.4	  vs  1,141.1</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures   394.1	  vs    386.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  42.8	  vs     50.8</p>
<p>    Other costs		  196.7	  vs    209.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  41.8	  vs    105.3</p>
<p>    Financial revenues	  17.1	  vs    431.1</p>
<p>    Financial expenditures    15.5	  vs    469.3</p>
<p>    Financial result	     1.5 profit vs     38.1 loss</p>
<p>    Extraordinary revenues    15.1	  vs	0.2</p>
<p>    Extraord. expenditures     4.4	  vs	9.2</p>
<p>    Extraordinary result	10.7 profit vs	9.0 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is  IBUSZ Rt. The figures are consolidated, unaudited, and were calculated according to the Hungarian Accounting Standards (HAS). The 1997 and 1996 figures are not fully comparative due to changes in the composition of the IBUSZ holding.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
